WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:04.190
I've brought Manatsu Daichi.

00:00:04.190 --> 00:00:05.610
Come in.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.330
I must apologize for yesterday's events.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:20.080
What are you talking about?

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:24.210
Our development schedule was experiencing some delays,

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:27.500
and unfortunately I vented my anger on you.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.090
A most childish action, I realize.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:37.260
I shall leave all trials of the Machine Goodfellows in your hands.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:40.890
Technology and Research Division 3 has been informed of this change.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:50.110
Welcome, Lord Amarok, Lady Malkin.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.900
I can't even begin to guess why Kube wouldn't be

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.740
in his office right now.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.070
The way he's acting really is strange.

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:00.120
What are you talking about?

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:02.910
Why has Kube's attitude suddenly changed?

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:06.120
Did losing <i>Legacy</i> drive him nuts?

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.960
No, he has other stock satellites.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.090
That was definitely a fun way to irritate him, but...

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:14.840
What did you do to him?

00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:20.220
I used subliminal messaging to make him fall in love with Makino Hitomi.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:24.850
His unrelenting focus on being the next leader of humanity

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:28.020
left him in a constant state of tension.

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:32.070
His time with Makino Hitomi has released much of that tension,

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:34.320
stabilizing his psyche.

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:38.320
He got suckered into dating someone, and it made him happy?

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:40.700
So that's all the man he ever was.

00:01:41.530 --> 00:01:46.410
Well, as long as it doesn't interfere with our plans, that's fine.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:48.790
Leave it to me.

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:51.040
Pac does not lie.

00:01:56.010 --> 00:01:58.470
The cameras can see us...

00:01:58.470 --> 00:02:00.470
Let them watch.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:02.720
You're so mean.

00:02:11.520 --> 00:02:15.990
I had no idea having a body was so much fun.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:20.740
"As long as it doesn't interfere with our plans, that's fine."

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.740
It's that kind of self-confidence that makes manipulating

00:02:24.740 --> 00:02:28.330
Earthlings and Planetary Gears alike so simple.

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:36.420
It's why I'm going to live in this town

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:43.550
I'm watching an endless dream

00:02:44.060 --> 00:02:50.020
Aren't you watching too?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:57.360
It's always close by no matter how far away it seems

00:02:57.990 --> 00:03:04.200
Can't you see it too?

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:09.710
The things you can't normally say

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:12.380
The things you try to express

00:03:12.380 --> 00:03:14.880
The things you're willing to fight for

00:03:14.880 --> 00:03:20.590
Standing on your own two feet

00:03:20.590 --> 00:03:27.270
The night sky illuminates them all

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:34.400
The first flash of lightning

00:03:34.400 --> 00:03:40.740
This is our battle to fight

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:48.080
It's why I'm going to live in this town

00:03:48.370 --> 00:03:56.590
This dream will absolutely come true

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.060
Cheerful!

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.560
Pounding!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.980
Heart!

00:04:16.860 --> 00:04:19.570
Here I am, everyone!

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:20.780
It's me, Ai!

00:04:21.690 --> 00:04:25.320
I love you!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:28.950
I love you all so much, I could just eat you!

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:33.830
And someday, I really will!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:46.640
Ai! Ai! Ai!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:44.340
Ai's really changed...

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:46.640
What happened?

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:53.730
The light shines through the feather in my grasp

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:59.520
As if it was merrily dancing

00:04:59.520 --> 00:05:05.280
I'd like our paths to cross

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:09.030
As we head towards warmth and kindness

00:05:09.030 --> 00:05:17.120
Let's begin our journey

00:05:18.960 --> 00:05:22.670
Not being able to get it whenever we want is extremely inconvenient.

00:05:23.090 --> 00:05:26.220
It'll only be until we turn into Kill-T-Gangs again.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.550
We can analyze Internet posts to find

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:32.770
areas with strong destructive impulses.

00:05:32.770 --> 00:05:33.890
It's easy.

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:38.520
Is the fluctuation index high for people around here?

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:45.190
I can't believe you're making a world-class idol come to some

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.490
hard to reach place like this.

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:51.410
Everyone's finally here.

00:06:16.850 --> 00:06:22.820
Lady Seiren, please forgive us for failing to conquer the Earth.

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:28.200
I never thought we would all see each other as avatars.

00:06:28.200 --> 00:06:30.620
Not everyone is here.

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:33.870
Now that you mention it, where is Albion?

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.370
He's gone.

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:36.750
Gone?

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:38.620
What happened to him?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:43.090
Albion destroyed his own Ego Block,

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:46.170
and ceased to be a Planetary Gear.

00:06:48.090 --> 00:06:50.180
I hadn't heard about that.

00:06:50.180 --> 00:06:54.810
He has become a soldier for Earth, and actively resists our invasion.

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.390
He also uses a Livlaster.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:01.810
He may be our greatest threat.

00:07:02.400 --> 00:07:06.230
He destroyed his Ego Block, and became a Neoteny?

00:07:06.230 --> 00:07:07.530
That's not all.

00:07:08.030 --> 00:07:11.030
The Princess of Blume has become a Neoteny, as well.

00:07:11.780 --> 00:07:17.950
Our plan originally called for her to fire a Livlaster, but...

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:22.120
I can't believe the <i>Blume</i> is now a weapon of the enemy.

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:24.710
It looks like we have some issues to deal with.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:31.510
Lady Seiren, have we gathered the appropriate amount of energy?

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.550
There will be only one this time.

00:07:34.350 --> 00:07:36.390
I would ask that you allow me.

00:07:36.760 --> 00:07:40.640
With me at the front, their destruction is assured.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.150
I will place my faith in you.

00:07:45.770 --> 00:07:48.360
We are the Planetary Gears.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.450
We reveal the world's dreams.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:09.460
They say Pitz's condition is stable.

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:12.880
What did the commander say?

00:08:13.510 --> 00:08:16.300
It's my fault that Pitz got hurt,

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.760
and we can't predict the enemy's actions.

00:08:19.470 --> 00:08:21.230
Did he yell at you for that?

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.560
It's okay. That wasn't it.

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.230
Then what was it?

00:08:29.440 --> 00:08:30.190
Well...

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.570
With Pitz out of commission for a while,

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.200
we're not going to be able to use Hana's singularity

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:39.660
to anticipate the enemy's next Orgone energy spike.

00:08:40.200 --> 00:08:44.790
We're unable to continue predicting their actions.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:46.210
I'm very sorry.

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.590
It's entirely my fault.

00:08:48.460 --> 00:08:51.130
I'm not interested in assigning blame for that.

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.590
I'm sorry to call you here from the hospital.

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:58.470
With regards to Mutou Hana,

00:08:58.470 --> 00:09:04.020
the loss of her predictive powers is immaterial compared to

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:09.440
her ability to fire a Livlaster, and her use of the <i>Blume</i>.

00:09:10.110 --> 00:09:13.320
And everyone that knows <i>Blume</i> has been activated...

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:16.950
is going to come after Hana, right?

00:09:18.320 --> 00:09:19.910
The Midsummer's Knights

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:24.540
have achieved their primary directive as an independent attack force.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:28.540
You will now proceed to the next stage.

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.550
The next stage?

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:34.050
You're returning to the original goal of the Intercept Faction.

00:09:35.670 --> 00:09:39.600
We are now initiating Operation Summer.

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:42.140
Operation Summer?

00:09:42.140 --> 00:09:44.100
Our next mission.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:46.350
What is it?

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:48.560
How are you doing?

00:09:49.310 --> 00:09:51.320
I brought you a watermelon.

00:09:51.320 --> 00:09:53.030
Hey, you already have one!

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.320
I bought one!

00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.030
Way to go.

00:09:56.030 --> 00:09:57.450
Where have you been?

00:09:57.450 --> 00:09:58.910
A shrine.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:01.080
It's been a while since I was last in Tanegashima, you know.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.580
I may not look it, but I'm a very traditional girl.

00:10:05.410 --> 00:10:08.460
I'm a <i>Japanesque</i> magic-user!

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:11.130
What do you do at a shrine?

00:10:13.090 --> 00:10:17.130
Talk to the gods and make requests, I guess?

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:19.130
The gods?

00:10:19.130 --> 00:10:21.640
I don't believe in them.

00:10:21.640 --> 00:10:22.930
I've never seen one.

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:27.810
Is it even possible to see a god?

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.900
Do you go to shrines, Captain?

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:31.860
Yep.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:36.360
On New Year's, or certain summer festival days.

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.320
Festivals?

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:39.110
What are they like?

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.070
You don't know?

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.330
They're fun.

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:44.790
There are all these stalls.

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:46.330
Stalls?

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.660
Places that sell good food and stuff.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:50.080
Good food?

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:51.830
I want to go.

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:53.290
Let's go.

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.170
Once our mission is completely done.

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:00.010
Let's go to a festival together.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:04.100
A festival!

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:06.600
So, what's the mission?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:10.730
Don't you think Hana would look great in a kimono, Captain?

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:14.770
I asked the gods for help with the mission.

00:11:16.480 --> 00:11:18.690
You really do know everything.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.700
Operation Summer?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:27.160
The altercations between the Independent Attack Force and the Machine Goodfellows

00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:33.210
were partially an attempt to buy time to prepare for this mission.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:38.130
The Intercept Faction intends to take out the Planetary Gears' mother ship,

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:44.970
the fortress-class carrier <i>Oberon</i>, in orbit around Uranus.

00:11:45.720 --> 00:11:47.560
That is Operation Summer.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.660
I was extremely careful in choosing this place.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.370
But if they do come here, take care of them.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:12.410
I know.

00:12:13.540 --> 00:12:15.210
Everyone's here.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:17.500
If even Aiatar can't do it,

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.170
we might need to come up with a new plan.

00:12:24.760 --> 00:12:26.050
Abreaction.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.560
What are you thinking about?

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.530
I was thinking about Albion.

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.990
Why would he destroy his Ego Block?

00:12:44.780 --> 00:12:50.330
What kind of life did you lead during the seventeen years before you awoke?

00:12:52.080 --> 00:12:54.040
I suppose there was plenty of bad stuff.

00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:58.090
But it wasn't all bad?

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:03.590
For me, it was mostly bad stuff, too.

00:13:04.550 --> 00:13:09.680
I'm still mad about being used by others.

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.600
I still can't forgive them.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:12.890
But...

00:13:13.850 --> 00:13:18.060
By absorbing the Earthlings' libidos,

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:22.360
it means we're using them.

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:27.320
Where did Lappa go?

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:55.980
Eyecatch

00:13:59.020 --> 00:14:00.610
AEO confirmed.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:01.820
It's a Kill-T-Gang!

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:05.940
Manifestation point is within Defensive Zone 2, Beta sector.

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.530
Notify Tanegashima immediately.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.990
Any residual effects from the solar flare two days ago?

00:14:10.990 --> 00:14:12.030
Not yet.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:14.540
A Kill-T-Gang has appeared.

00:14:14.540 --> 00:14:15.750
It's a Type-5!

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.170
Aiatar?

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:23.340
I told you to rest!

00:14:23.340 --> 00:14:24.710
We can't right now!

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.300
Distance 35,000 kilometers.

00:14:26.300 --> 00:14:28.180
Speed 50 kilometers per second.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:29.470
It's heading straight for Earth!

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:35.100
They're both injured, and the Earth and Nebula are both being repaired.

00:14:36.230 --> 00:14:38.810
Activate Flare Engine launch sequence!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:40.310
Flare?

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.610
Activating Flare Engine launch sequence.

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.490
This is Mutou Hana.

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.620
Roger that, orders confirmed.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.240
Hana's going to launch?

00:14:54.660 --> 00:14:56.290
I'll go, Commander!

00:14:56.290 --> 00:14:59.330
Hana underwent the same training as Teppei for a very long time.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.840
And this was her suggestion.

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:04.340
But...

00:15:04.920 --> 00:15:07.460
My accuracy is way better than Teppei's.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:14.390
And it's my fault you two were injured.

00:15:15.930 --> 00:15:18.100
Please let me go.

00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:20.100
Hana...

00:15:22.310 --> 00:15:23.940
Make sure you come back safely.

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:27.690
That's my condition.

00:15:30.450 --> 00:15:31.240
Roger!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:50.630
Expansion sequence activated.

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:00.140
The Flare Engine's energy is charging.

00:16:00.140 --> 00:16:02.140
The Pegasus has purged it!

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:07.900
Flare Engine, expand!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:15.620
Adjusting relative vectors.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:20.160
Delta RV 3.2, 2.6, 0.7.

00:16:20.160 --> 00:16:21.710
First expand!

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.750
Tidal attractor functioning normally.

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.920
Delta RV is within threshold.

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:32.470
Combined robustness is at maximum!

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:34.260
Second expand!

00:16:45.100 --> 00:16:47.020
Preparing Orgone connection.

00:16:47.020 --> 00:16:49.320
All systems are nominal.

00:16:49.320 --> 00:16:51.530
Final expand!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.180
An Impactor that isn't in our data?

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.550
Another one?

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:23.640
In this business, there are always new girls.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.810
That's why it's so hard to survive!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:33.280
Hana!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:34.440
I'm fine!

00:17:35.650 --> 00:17:36.610
Calm down.

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:38.870
Stay calm... I can see them.

00:17:42.490 --> 00:17:43.160
No...

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:44.910
I can't hit her?

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:46.370
She's jumping around.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.130
Wow.

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.420
She's predicting the enemy's attacks?

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:58.390
Does her precognition <i>really</i> rely on Pitz?

00:17:58.390 --> 00:18:01.810
Not that I think she's lying...

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:04.640
She obviously thinks it does,

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:08.690
but maybe it's actually her own singularity?

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:10.560
Just like my magic?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:12.070
No...

00:18:12.070 --> 00:18:13.360
I don't know about that.

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.400
Just as Rita says,

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:19.240
that instinctive precognition can probably be used for attacks.

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:20.320
Hana!

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:22.280
Just attack her!

00:18:22.280 --> 00:18:23.450
Roger!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:34.090
I'll steal your happiness like a vampire!

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.470
A barrier?

00:18:39.470 --> 00:18:40.300
No.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.770
Aiatar can absorb the beam's energy?

00:18:53.230 --> 00:18:54.360
My attacks aren't working!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.400
Delicious.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:19:00.860
So this is the Livlaster's Orgone energy!

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:04.410
I can feel the power rising inside me!

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:14.800
And now I'm filled with Orgone energy!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.420
You can't escape me.

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:26.470
I've got you.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:35.070
Calm down, Hana.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:36.320
I'll help you!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:36.860
Commander!

00:19:38.190 --> 00:19:41.110
The coronal mass ejection is sending a stream of charged particles toward us!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:44.160
The solar flare from two days ago is showing up now?

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.540
Radiation density is increasing.

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.250
The electrical circuits are saturated, and we can't communicate!

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.290
Hana!

00:19:55.630 --> 00:19:57.590
The end!

00:20:00.340 --> 00:20:02.220
A CME storm?

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:09.810
I can't see anything.

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.230
But...

00:20:12.890 --> 00:20:17.110
I know where she is because she absorbed my energy!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:22.950
She's coming.

00:20:58.570 --> 00:21:00.360
Communications are back online!

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:06.110
The Kill-T-Gang has been successfully intercepted.

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.700
Hana...

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.410
Looks like my prayer was heard.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:21.250
As planned, I'm returning the dummy capsule to Earth.

00:21:22.300 --> 00:21:22.960
Thanks.

00:21:23.470 --> 00:21:26.930
You want them to believe the Flare Engine is back on Earth, right?

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.220
Yes.

00:21:28.220 --> 00:21:30.430
Just keep Hana for three days.

00:21:31.560 --> 00:21:35.350
In ten days, we'll commence Operation Summer.

00:21:37.690 --> 00:21:41.900
This footage of <i>Oberon</i> was just taken by <i>Cassini 3</i>.

00:21:43.610 --> 00:21:45.570
It's emitting a light?

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:50.370
This light also appeared nine years ago,

00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:53.040
when the Type-1 attacked the first time.

00:21:53.700 --> 00:21:59.580
We must not forget the tragedy in which the Type-1 wiped out Daedalus Base.

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:04.130
The light is much brighter this time, too.

00:22:04.630 --> 00:22:08.470
A full-scale war will exterminate humanity.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.930
Yes.

00:22:09.930 --> 00:22:14.810
That's right. Human weapons haven't once succeeded

00:22:14.810 --> 00:22:18.100
in destroying a Kill-T-Gang's real body: its Ego Block.

00:22:18.690 --> 00:22:20.940
The Intercept Faction's increasing arrogance

00:22:20.940 --> 00:22:24.320
after temporarily halting the invasion is the real threat.

00:22:24.860 --> 00:22:27.320
<i>Blume</i> has already activated.

00:22:28.150 --> 00:22:32.580
It's almost time to implement our plan—one which will create a new future for humanity.

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:35.700
The reaping draws ever closer.

00:22:36.330 --> 00:22:39.960
In that case, we must act with conviction.

00:24:13.640 --> 00:24:16.550
A new observer has been sent to Tanegashima.

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:20.140
A scary woman, one of Salty Dog's female operatives.

00:24:20.560 --> 00:24:23.730
Then two Kill-T-Gangs attack!

00:24:24.310 --> 00:24:26.270
The Ark Faction uses their trump card,

00:24:26.270 --> 00:24:30.110
the unmanned Impactors <i>Cerberus</i>, to intercept them.

00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:31.240
But...

00:24:32.360 --> 00:24:35.200
Next time, on episode 17 of <i>Captain Earth</i>:

00:24:35.740 --> 00:24:37.160
The Midsummer's Knights.

00:24:37.950 --> 00:24:41.120
Belly Button Forte is back!
